{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<p>TODOs on improving this blog.</p>\n"},{"cell_type":"markdown","source":"<h2>TODOs to improve this blog platform:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>✅ Add support for code blocks (inline markdown code)</li>\n<li>✅ Add emoji shorthands 😂</li>\n<li>✅ Add support for MathJAX</li>\n<li>⏱️ Add support for Jupyter code cells (REPL)\n<ul>\n<li>✅ Code is rendering</li>\n<li>✅ Syntax highlighting uses <code>kernelspec</code> or <code>language_info</code> metadata from the notebook to determine the language</li>\n<li>✅ stdout and stderr</li>\n<li>❌ stdout and stderr are separate for some reason instead of interleaved. This seems to be intended behavior with Jupyter notebooks ☹️</li>\n<li>✅ Display output renderer</li>\n<li>❌ Error renderer</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>❌ Add some components that can be added via raw blocks</li>\n<li>❌ Improve sorting support, currently sorted by publish date</li>\n<li>❌ Add automatic rebuilds of notebooks on save (nextjs is already able to render updated notebooks with <code>next dev</code>.</li>\n<li>✅ Add hyperlinks to titles</li>\n<li>❌ Sync hyperlinks / headings with the navbar</li>\n<li>❌ Pagination of the homepage and blogs page</li>\n<li>❌ Multi-page pages and blogs</li>\n<li>❌ Better tooling for handling metadata. Plugin for Jupyter or Jupyterlab?</li>\n<li>❌ GitHub actions workflow</li>\n<li>✅ Cloudflare pages support\n<ul>\n<li>Already deployed to Cloudflare Pages</li>\n<li>Deploy as Next JS (static export)</li>\n<li>Need to use node 22.13.0+. CF pages defaults to Node 18</li>\n<li>Add environment variable <code>NODE_VERSION</code> as <code>22.13.0</code> or latest when setting up your project.</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>❌ Dark mode (theoretically should be supported, but it doesn’t work)</li>\n<li>❌ Use CSS/Tailwind variables instead of hardcoded values / colors everywhere</li>\n</ul>\n"}],"metadata":{"img":{},"pageinfo":{"title":"TODOs to improve this blog platform","author":"yash101","published":"2025-01-30T04:57:57.694Z","lastModified":"2025-01-30T04:57:57.694Z","slug":"todos","publishedOn":null,"lastModifiedOn":null}},"additionalRawHtml":"\n<style type=\"text/css\">\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] > svg {\n  display: inline;\n  z-index: 0;\n  max-width: 100%;\n  overflow-x: auto;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] {\n  direction: ltr;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] > svg {\n  overflow: visible;\n  min-height: 1px;\n  min-width: 1px;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] > svg a {\n  fill: blue;\n  stroke: blue;\n}\n\nmjx-assistive-mml {\n  position: absolute !important;\n  top: 0px;\n  left: 0px;\n  clip: rect(1px, 1px, 1px, 1px);\n  padding: 1px 0px 0px 0px !important;\n  border: 0px !important;\n  display: block !important;\n  width: auto !important;\n  overflow: hidden !important;\n  -webkit-touch-callout: none;\n  -webkit-user-select: none;\n  -khtml-user-select: none;\n  -moz-user-select: none;\n  -ms-user-select: none;\n  user-select: none;\n}\n\nmjx-assistive-mml[display=\"block\"] {\n  width: 100% !important;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"][display=\"true\"] {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  margin: 1em 0;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"][display=\"true\"][width=\"full\"] {\n  display: flex;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"][justify=\"left\"] {\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"][justify=\"right\"] {\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"merror\"] > g {\n  fill: red;\n  stroke: red;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"merror\"] > rect[data-background] {\n  fill: yellow;\n  stroke: none;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"mtable\"] > line[data-line], svg[data-table] > g > line[data-line] {\n  stroke-width: 70px;\n  fill: none;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"mtable\"] > rect[data-frame], svg[data-table] > g > rect[data-frame] {\n  stroke-width: 70px;\n  fill: none;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"mtable\"] > .mjx-dashed, svg[data-table] > g > .mjx-dashed {\n  stroke-dasharray: 140;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"mtable\"] > .mjx-dotted, svg[data-table] > g > .mjx-dotted {\n  stroke-linecap: round;\n  stroke-dasharray: 0,140;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"mtable\"] > g > svg {\n  overflow: visible;\n}\n\n[jax=\"SVG\"] mjx-tool {\n  display: inline-block;\n  position: relative;\n  width: 0;\n  height: 0;\n}\n\n[jax=\"SVG\"] mjx-tool > mjx-tip {\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 0;\n  left: 0;\n}\n\nmjx-tool > mjx-tip {\n  display: inline-block;\n  padding: .2em;\n  border: 1px solid #888;\n  font-size: 70%;\n  background-color: #F8F8F8;\n  color: black;\n  box-shadow: 2px 2px 5px #AAAAAA;\n}\n\ng[data-mml-node=\"maction\"][data-toggle] {\n  cursor: pointer;\n}\n\nmjx-status {\n  display: block;\n  position: fixed;\n  left: 1em;\n  bottom: 1em;\n  min-width: 25%;\n  padding: .2em .4em;\n  border: 1px solid #888;\n  font-size: 90%;\n  background-color: #F8F8F8;\n  color: black;\n}\n\nforeignObject[data-mjx-xml] {\n  font-family: initial;\n  line-height: normal;\n  overflow: visible;\n}\n\nmjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] path[data-c], mjx-container[jax=\"SVG\"] use[data-c] {\n  stroke-width: 3;\n}\n\n</style>\n    "}